  <Strings>
    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <JapaneseText>ダリルシェイド地下水路</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Darilsheid Prison, Underground Canal</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <JapaneseText>ダリルシェイド地下水路</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Darilsheid Prison, Underground Canal</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <JapaneseText>ダリルシェイド地下水路</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Darilsheid Prison, Underground Canal</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <JapaneseText>ここが出口だ
街の外へとつながっている</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>This is the exit.
It leads to the outskirts of the city.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <JapaneseText>しかし、思ったより時間がかかったな
まったく、僕ひとりなら
もっと早く出られたものを････</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>However, that certainly took much longer than I had expected.
Honestly, I could have gotten out of here
a lot faster had I been alone...</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <JapaneseText>はいはい、言ってろよ
ったく････</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah, yeah, tell it to the press. Geez...</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Kyle&gt;、こんなヤツほっといて
とっとと孤児院に戻ろうぜ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Kyle&gt;, let's ditch this guy and get back
to the orphanage as soon as possible.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <JapaneseText>あ、うん</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ah, right.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <JapaneseText>どうした？　早くもどって
旅に出るんじゃなかったのか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What's the matter?
Weren't you going to hurry back
and start on a journey?</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Judas&gt;
ホント、ありがとう！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Judas&gt;, thanks a lot!</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <JapaneseText>別に、礼を言われる筋合いはない</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>There's no reason for you to thank me.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <JapaneseText>それでも、ありがとう
ホントに助かったよ！
Even so, thanks.</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You really helped us out!</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <JapaneseText>････</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <JapaneseText>それじゃあね、&lt;Judas&gt;
またどこかで会えるといいね！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well then, later, &lt;Judas&gt;.
Hopefully, we'll meet again sometime!</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Kyle&gt;････</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Kyle&gt;...</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <JapaneseText>なに？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What?</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <JapaneseText>僕は、おまえといっしょに････</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'd like to go with...</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <JapaneseText>････いや、なんでもない</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>No, it's nothing.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <JapaneseText>英雄になりたければ
せいぜい、がんばることだ
じゃあな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>If you want to become a hero,
then I wish you the best of luck.
See you around.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <JapaneseText>････なんかさ
&lt;Judas&gt;って不思議だよね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That &lt;Judas&gt;, he's kinda mysterious, isn't he?</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <JapaneseText>不思議ぃ？
ああいうのは不思議じゃなくて
「ヘン」っていうんだぞ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Uh, no. I think the word you're
looking for is &quot;weird,&quot; not mysterious.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <JapaneseText>言い過ぎだよ、&lt;Loni&gt;
&lt;Judas&gt;はいい人だよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That was harsh, &lt;Loni&gt;. Judas is a nice guy.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <JapaneseText>自分ひとりでも、脱出できたのに
オレたちを連れ出してくれたりさ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>He could have escaped by himself and all,
but he brought us along with him instead.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <JapaneseText>それに今だって
オレのこと、励ましてくれたし！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And besides, he cheered me on just now!</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <JapaneseText>････あのな&lt;Kyle&gt;
あれは皮肉だ、励ましじゃない</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Um, earth to Kyle, that was sarcasm, not encouragement.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <JapaneseText>そうかなぁ････</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You think so...?</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>27</Id>
      <JapaneseText>そんなことより、早く孤児院に戻るぞ
すっかり遅くなっちまったから、急ごうぜ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>More importantly though, let's hurry back to the orphanage.
We're late as hell, so we'd better book it.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <JapaneseText>いってらっしゃいませ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Have a good day.</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>29</Id>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;0B:00000001&gt;{14}{34}{08}{C0}&lt;0B:00000000&gt;ガルドになりますが
お泊まりになりますか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It'll be &lt;0B:00000001&gt;{14}{34}{08}{C0}&lt;0B:00000000&gt; gald a night.
Would you like to stay?</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>30</Id>
      <JapaneseText>お泊まりになりますか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Would you like to stay?</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>31</Id>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;03:00000000&gt;　はい　
　いいえ　</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;03:00000000&gt; Yes 
 No </EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>32</Id>
      <JapaneseText>ごゆっくりお休みください</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Have a good night.</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>33</Id>
      <JapaneseText>おはようございます</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Good morning.</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>34</Id>
      <JapaneseText>お金が足りません</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Not enough money.</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>35</Id>
      <JapaneseText>またのおこしをお待ちしております</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>See you again soon.</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>36</Id>
      <JapaneseText>{16}{25}{CE}{C0}を手に入れました</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Acquired {16}{25}{CE}{C0}.</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>37</Id>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;item:FFFFFFFF&gt;を手に入れました</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Acquired &lt;item:FFFFFFFF&gt;.</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>38</Id>
      <JapaneseText>{16}{25}{D6}{C0}がありましたが
いっぱいで持てませんでした</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Acquired {16}{25}{D6}{C0} but
inventory is full already.</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>39</Id>
      <JapaneseText>何もありません</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>There's nothing here.</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
